                                                                                
  Usage: bab free [OPTIONS]                                                     
                                                                                
  Options                                                                       
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
       --kind        [gpu|cpu]           partitions to show [default=gpu]       
       --nodes                           add a per-node table                   
  -p   --partition   TEXT                limit the node table to one partition  
  -G   --gpu-type    TEXT                only this GPU type, e.g. a5000         
  -w   --watch       [SECONDS] [x>=10]   refresh every SECONDS (default 10)     
                                         until Ctrl-C                           
  -h   --help                            Show this message and exit.            
                                                                                
                                                                                
